  "nextAction": "D251 / S03.acceptance: inspect the confirmed internal API rate-limiting gap at full product-spec requirement 6207, then implement a reviewed explicit private server limiter and policy for the affected API/license signer path. Keep active S03 and all acceptance statuses unchanged. Inspect current API/worker/signing contracts before choosing scope or policy; do not invent provider thresholds or assume an in-memory budget is production protection. Require explicit server-side admission, budget exhaustion with 429 and Retry-After, time-window/reset and principal/route isolation through meaningful focused tests. No provider credentials, payment activation, new SDK, remote database apply, deployment, app/PWA/native rebuild or unrelated suite repetition. Preserve D250 verified-payment queue, single-connection SQL and evidence from 105 tests tied to source without treating it as live PSP, multi-connection concurrency, S21 or release acceptance.",
